00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,643
Most people are dehydrated, and don't even know it.

2
00:00:04,893 --> 00:00:09,762
Feeling tired, foggy, or snacky? Sometimes your body just needs water.

3
00:00:10,712 --> 00:00:13,601
One. Start your morning with a full glass of water.

4
00:00:14,551 --> 00:00:17,174
Two. Keep a water bottle where you can see it.

5
00:00:18,124 --> 00:00:22,090
Three. Eat water-rich foods, like watermelon and cucumber.

6
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:25,980
Four. Drink a glass of water with every meal.

7
00:00:26,930 --> 00:00:30,405
How many glasses did you drink today? Tell me in the comments.

8
00:00:32,055 --> 00:00:34,817
Follow me for more health and wellness content.

